222", "widgets_values": ["video/MiniMax_H3_I2VA", "auto", "auto"], "inputs": [{"name": "video", "link": 23, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "视频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "格式"}, {"widget": {"name": "codec"}, "name": "codec", "label": "codec", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "编码器"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveVideo", "title": "保存视频", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#333", "size": [210, 288.9090881347656], "pos": [2240, 860], "id": 20, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"codec": true, "filename_prefix": true, "format": true}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveVideo"}, "order": 20}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#446688", "widgets_values": ["| megapixels | Aspect 16:9 | 说明 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0.2 | 608 x 352 | 最低 |\n| 0.4 | 864 x 480 | 低 |\n| 0.6 | 1056 x 608 | **推荐** |\n| 0.8 | 1216 x 672 | 高 |\n| 1.0 | 1376 x 768 | 高清 |\n| 1.5 | 1664 x 928 | 超清 |\n| 2.0 | 1920 x 1088 | 最高 |"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335577", "size": [350, 250], "pos": [20, 1180], "id": 21, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#446688", "widgets_values": ["MiniMax H3 图生视频+音频 (I2VA) 工作流\n基于 ComfyUI 内置 MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo 节点\n\n功能：上传首帧图片 + 文字提示词 → 生成带原生音频的视频\n\n数据流：\n  UNETLoader + CLIPLoader + VAELoader → MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo\n  LoadImage(首帧) → MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo\n  ResolutionSelector → width/height → MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo\n  PrimitiveFloat(时长) → ComfyMathExpression → length → MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo\n  MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo → positive + LATENT\n  → BasicGuider + SamplerCustomAdvanced → LATENT\n  → VAEDecode(视频) + VAEDecodeAudio(音频)\n  → CreateVideo → SaveVideo\n\n模型文件（RH 平台已预装）：\n  DiT模型: minimax_h3_fl2va_int8_convrot.safetensors\n  文本编码器: qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\n  视频VAE: minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n  音频VAE: minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n\n参数说明：\n  aspect_ratio: 16:9 / 9:16 / 1:1\n  megapixels: 0.2~2.0（推荐0.6）\n  duration_seconds: 视频时长（秒，推荐5~10）\n  steps: 采样步数（推荐25）\n  fps: 帧率（默认24）"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335577", "size": [450, 360], "pos": [20, 20], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [3], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#332", "widgets_values": ["example.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "图像", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "选择文件上传", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#553", "size": [300, 314], "pos": [20, 420], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [4], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["[镜头 1] 10秒一镜到底的电影级场景，16:9横屏。画面从上传的首帧图片开始，镜头缓缓推进。画面中的人物开始微笑，微风轻轻吹动发丝和衣角。第3秒，镜头缓慢平移到侧面，展现人物侧脸轮廓和柔和的自然光线。第6秒，阳光从云层缝隙中洒下，形成温暖的光斑效果。第8秒，镜头回到正面中景，人物深情凝视镜头，自然收尾。\n\n整体环境音：微风声、远处鸟鸣、树叶沙沙声。\n非叙事性音乐：温暖的钢琴旋律，搭配轻柔的弦乐背景。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "提示词输入", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [480, 400], "pos": [20, 760], "id": 10, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "positive", "slot_index": 0, "links": [9], "label": "